# Line endings are part of this repository's identity: SPEC_MANIFEST.json pins
# the sha256 of 44 spec files, and Git for Windows' installer default
# (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites every text file to CRLF on checkout — which
# mismatches all 44 hashes on a byte-identical clone. Every tracked file is
# text, so one rule normalizes the lot.
* text=auto eol=lf
